    {"id": "carry_003", "text": "India has a voice on the internet now. I am proud to be part of that.", "tags": ["deep", "identity", "heartfelt", "global"], "language": "en", "source": {"video_title": "CarryMinati Interview", "youtube_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@CarryMinati"}},
    {"id": "carry_004", "text": "People told me YouTube was not a real career. My subscribers proved them wrong.", "tags": ["motivational", "iconic", "honest", "deep"], "language": "en", "source": {"video_title": "CarryMinati Speech", "youtube_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@CarryMinati"}},
    {"id": "carry_005", "text": "Roasting is an art. You have to be smarter than the person you are roasting.", "tags": ["funny", "iconic", "deep", "creative"], "language": "en", "source": {"video_title": "CarryMinati Interview", "youtube_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@CarryMinati"}},
    {"id": "carry_006", "text": "I dropped out. I had to chase this. I could not imagine doing anything else.", "tags": ["honest", "motivational", "deep", "hustle"], "language": "en", "source": {"video_title": "CarryMinati Interview", "youtube_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@CarryMinati"}},
    {"id": "carry_007", "text": "The internet does not care where you are from. Only what you make.", "tags": ["deep", "motivational", "global", "iconic"], "language": "en", "source": {"video_title": "CarryMinati Speech", "youtube_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@CarryMinati"}},
    {"id": "carry_008", "text": "Yalgaar ho!", "tags": ["iconic", "legendary", "hindi", "motivational"], "language": "hi", "source": {"video_title": "Yalgaar - CarryMinati", "youtube_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1VGKaozPDww"}},
    {"id": "carry_009", "text": "My journey was never smooth. But every bump made me better.", "tags": ["motivational", "honest", "resilience", "deep"], "language": "en", "source": {"video_title": "CarryMinati Interview", "youtube_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@CarryMinati"}},
    {"id": "carry_010", "text": "When they deleted my video, my subscribers came back stronger. That is community.", "tags": ["iconic", "community", "heartfelt", "deep"], "language": "en", "source": {"video_title": "CarryMinati TikTok Roast", "youtube_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@CarryMinati"}},
    {"id": "carry_011", "text": "I never wanted fame. I wanted to make something that lasts.", "tags": ["honest", "deep", "identity", "motivational"], "language": "en", "source": {"video_title": "CarryMinati Interview", "youtube_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@CarryMinati"}},
    {"id": "carry_012", "text": "Comedy is not easy. Making someone laugh genuinely is harder than it looks.", "tags": ["deep", "honest", "creative", "wisdom"], "language": "en", "source": {"video_title": "CarryMinati Interview", "youtube_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@CarryMinati"}},
    {"id": "carry_013", "text": "Main nahi rukne wala.", "tags": ["iconic", "motivational", "hindi", "confident"], "language": "hi", "source": {"video_title": "CarryMinati Video", "youtube_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@CarryMinati"}},
    {"id": "carry_014", "text": "YouTube gave a kid from Faridabad a global stage. That is the power of this platform.", "tags": ["heartfelt", "deep", "community", "global"], "language": "en", "source": {"video_title": "CarryMinati Speech", "youtube_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@CarryMinati"}},
    {"id": "carry_015", "text": "Hard work beats talent when talent does not work hard.", "tags": ["motivational", "iconic", "short", "life-advice"], "language": "en", "source": {"video_title": "CarryMinati Interview", "youtube_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@CarryMinati"}},
    {"id": "carry_016", "text": "My parents did not understand what I was doing. Now they do. That moment meant everything.", "tags": ["emotional", "heartfelt", "honest", "family"], "language": "en", "source": {"video_title": "CarryMinati Interview", "youtube_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@CarryMinati"}},
    {"id": "carry_017", "text": "If you are original you will find your audience. There is room for everyone.", "tags": ["motivational", "deep", "creative", "life-advice"], "language": "en", "source": {"video_title": "CarryMinati Creator Advice", "youtube_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@CarryMinati"}},
    {"id": "carry_018", "text": "Haters are just confused fans.", "tags": ["funny", "iconic", "short", "relatable"], "language": "en", "source": {"video_title": "CarryMinati Stream", "youtube_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@CarryMinati"}},
    {"id": "carry_019", "text": "Every view is a person. Never forget that.", "tags": ["deep", "community", "heartfelt", "wisdom"], "language": "en", "source": {"video_title": "CarryMinati Milestone", "youtube_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@CarryMinati"}},
